---
layout: base.njk
title: Achievements | BH II Toastmasters Singapore
description: "BH II Toastmasters has been President's Distinguished every year since 1998. See our contest wins, 29 club presidents, and why we ranked World No. 5 in 1999. Singapore's most consistent Toastmasters club."
---

<section id="wrapper">
  <header style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(10,15,28,0.70), rgba(10,15,28,0.70)), url('/images/award.jpg'); background-size:cover; background-position:center;">
    <div class="inner">
      <h2>What We Have Achieved</h2>
      <p>Chartered in 1998. President's Distinguished every year since. A club built on people who show up.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="inner">

      <h3 class="major">Our Story</h3>
      <p>{{ achievements.clubHistory }}</p>

      <h3 class="major" style="margin-top:3rem;">Award Certificates</h3>
      <p>Original letters and certificates from Toastmasters International recognising BH II's achievements since its founding year.</p>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:1.5rem;margin-top:1.5rem;">
        <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;">
          <img src="/images/award-certs/cert-presidents-distinguished-linda-ong.jpg" alt="Letter from TM International President recognising BH II as President's Top Five Distinguished Club 1998-99" style="width:100%;height:340px;object-fit:cover;object-position:top;display:block;" />
          <p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);padding:0.75rem;">President's Top Five Distinguished Club, 1998/1999. Letter from International President Terry R. Daily, DTM.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;">
          <img src="/images/award-certs/cert-membership-campaign-linda-ong.jpg" alt="Letter recognising BH II as Top 5 Membership Campaign 1998-99" style="width:100%;height:340px;object-fit:cover;object-position:top;display:block;" />
          <p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);padding:0.75rem;">Top 5 Membership Campaign, 1998/1999. Letter from Executive Director Terrence J. McCann.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;">
          <img src="/images/award-certs/cert-3.jpeg" alt="District 51 certificate to Linda Ong for achieving President's Distinguished District 1999-2000" style="width:100%;height:340px;object-fit:cover;object-position:top;display:block;" />
          <p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);padding:0.75rem;">President's Distinguished District, 1999/2000. Certificate to Linda Ong (Founding President) from District Governor Maimunah Natasha, DTM.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3 class="major" style="margin-top:3rem;">Club Awards</h3>
      <p>The President's Distinguished Club award is the highest level of the Toastmasters Distinguished Club Program, awarded to clubs that meet 9 of 10 annual performance goals. BH II has achieved this award every year since founding.</p>
      <div class="table-wrapper">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Programme Year</th><th>Award</th><th>Notes</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {% for award in achievements.clubAwards %}
            <tr>
              <td>{{ award.year }}</td>
              <td>{{ award.award }}</td>
              <td>{{ award.notes }}</td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h3 class="major" style="margin-top:3rem;">Notable Contest Achievements</h3>
      <div class="table-wrapper">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Year</th><th>Member</th><th>Achievement</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {% for win in achievements.contestWins %}
            <tr>
              <td>{{ win.year }}</td>
              <td>{{ win.member }}</td>
              <td>{{ win.achievement }}</td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:0.8rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);">Note: Braddell Heights Community Club is the only CC to have permanently retained the Inter-CC Humorous Speech Trophy, won three years in a row by BH II members.</p>

      <h3 class="major" style="margin-top:3rem;">Hall of Fame: Area Governors</h3>
      <p>BH II members who have gone on to serve the wider Toastmasters community as Area Governors and Directors.</p>
      <div class="table-wrapper">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Term</th><th>Member</th><th>Role</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {% for person in achievements.areaGovernors %}
            <tr>
              <td>{{ person.term }}</td>
              <td>{{ person.name }}</td>
              <td>{{ person.role }}</td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h3 class="major" style="margin-top:3rem;">Past Presidents</h3>
      <p>BH II has been led by {{ achievements.presidents | length }} presidents since its founding in 1998. We are grateful to every one of them for their service and the culture they helped build.</p>
      <div class="table-wrapper">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>#</th><th>Term</th><th>President</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {% for p in achievements.presidents %}
            <tr>
              <td>{{ p.number }}</td>
              <td>{{ p.term }}</td>
              <td>
                {{ p.name }}
                {% if p.note %}<em style="color:#F2DF74;"> ({{ p.note }})</em>{% endif %}
              </td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h3 class="major" style="margin-top:3rem;">Members in Action</h3>
      <p>Snapshots of BH II members receiving awards and recognition at district and area events.</p>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:1.2rem;margin-top:1.5rem;">
        <div style="overflow:hidden;border-radius:4px;">
          <img src="/images/awards/award-cert-4.jpeg" alt="BH II receiving President's Distinguished Club award at District 80 Hall of Fame 2023-2024" style="width:100%;height:220px;object-fit:cover;display:block;" />
          <p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);padding:0.6rem 0 0;">President's Distinguished Club, District 80 Hall of Fame 2023/2024</p>
        </div>
        <div style="overflow:hidden;border-radius:4px;">
          <img src="/images/awards/award-cert-1.jpeg" alt="Michael Spencer Go receiving Dedicated Area Director award at Division Y Achievers Day" style="width:100%;height:220px;object-fit:cover;display:block;" />
          <p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);padding:0.6rem 0 0;">Michael Spencer Go, Dedicated Area Director, Division Y Achievers' Day</p>
        </div>
        <div style="overflow:hidden;border-radius:4px;">
          <img src="/images/awards/award-cert-2.jpeg" alt="Ravindran Pandian at District 80 Area G1 International Speech Contest 2024/2025" style="width:100%;height:220px;object-fit:cover;display:block;" />
          <p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);padding:0.6rem 0 0;">Ravindran Pandian, District 80 Area G1 International Speech Contest 2024/2025</p>
        </div>
        <div style="overflow:hidden;border-radius:4px;">
          <img src="/images/awards/award-cert-3.jpeg" alt="BH II member receiving award at external event" style="width:100%;height:220px;object-fit:cover;display:block;" />
          <p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);padding:0.6rem 0 0;">Member receiving recognition at a district event</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ul class="actions" style="margin-top:2rem;">
        <li><a href="/join/" class="button primary">Be Part of the Next Chapter</a></li>
        <li><a href="/experience/" class="button">See How We Meet</a></li>
      </ul>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
